{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your limits. Fly closer. Score higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare Up: Adrenaline is an arcade wingsuit base-jumping game where skill, precision, and guts define the best base jumpers in the world. The closer you fly to cliffs, trees, and obstacles, the more points you earn \u2014 but one wrong move, and you\u2019ll crash hard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme Wingsuit Flight:</strong> <br>Experience fast-paced, low-altitude flying across stunning open environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/125b4b0a37262c78f979991a6fd545f8.avif?t=1762313404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras_big/125b4b0a37262c78f979991a6fd545f8.avif?t=1762313404 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Scoring:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The closer you fly to the ground, the bigger your multiplier \u2014 risk it all for glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/69fe1c3c65dc3c0bdd85c0c6115ecdb1.avif?t=1762313404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras_big/69fe1c3c65dc3c0bdd85c0c6115ecdb1.avif?t=1762313404 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends or compete with the world to claim your place among the Top 10 daredevils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/5c81023a8c1800eb0aa0dc148fdc131a.avif?t=1762313404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras_big/5c81023a8c1800eb0aa0dc148fdc131a.avif?t=1762313404 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal Events:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season brings new challenges, new locations, and fresh rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/8ed75da8c760029a34267309071c7d69.avif?t=1762313404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras_big/8ed75da8c760029a34267309071c7d69.avif?t=1762313404 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Wingsuits:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new wingsuit designs and show off your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/646ccdea7624c7637fd823c80c588e29.avif?t=1762313404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras_big/646ccdea7624c7637fd823c80c588e29.avif?t=1762313404 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay System:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch how the pros earn their massive scores and learn new lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras/1e74f15f22de33c869ba89fcde10aca9.avif?t=1762313404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/extras_big/1e74f15f22de33c869ba89fcde10aca9.avif?t=1762313404 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Crash Physics:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly too close, and the mountain will remind you who\u2019s boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Arcade eSport</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just another flying game \u2014 Dare Up: Adrenaline is a competitive eSport experience, designed for players who crave speed, precision, and bragging rights. Every flight is a dare \u2014 and only the best make it to the podium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do You Dare?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season, new terrains appear and the leaderboard resets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So\u2026 how close will you fly?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4141620?t=1762313404","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4141620?t=1762313404","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/c6be06fc8d114a680ee40ab16354b188188448db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762313404","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141620/c6be06fc8d114a680ee40ab16354b188188448db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762313404","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your limits. Fly closer. Score higher.</p><p class=\"bb_